   1| /**
   2|  * MIPS Virtual Machine in JavaScript
   3|  * 
   4|  * This VM implements the core MIPS instruction set for use in a MIPS-to-JavaScript compiler.
   5|  * It handles register operations, memory access, and program flow control.
   6|  */
